# Ship only the bundles, webview assets, schemas and docs. Everything else (sources, tests, fixtures,
# source maps, node_modules, the .vscode-test download) stays out of the .vsix.
# vsce lets a negation win over any ignore pattern, so the shipped files are listed explicitly.
**
!package.json
!dist/extension.js
!media/*.svg
!media/icon.png
!media/webview/*.js
!media/webview/*.css
!media/webview/assets/**
!schemas/*.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
